{
  "name": "happy",
  "integration": "netdata",
  "description": "A Netdata Parent with two children streaming to it. Proves the /api/v3/nodes listing is parsed into one asset per node, that the agent's own node (hops 0) is enriched from the unprefixed /api/v1/info while each child is enriched from /host/<node name>/api/v1/info, and that the machine GUID becomes the foreign id. Node and info bodies follow the nodeFull and info schemas in Netdata's own netdata-swagger.yaml.",

